<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.2">
<l>vaḷaittuvait tēṉiṉip pōkaloṭ ṭēṉuṉ taṉintira ñālaṅkaḷā</l>
<l>loḷittiṭil niṉtiru vāṇaikaṇ ṭāynī yoruvarkkum meyyaṉallai</l>
<l>yaḷitteṅkum nāṭum nakaramun tammuṭait tīviṉai tīrkkaluṟṟu</l>
<l>teḷittu valañceyyun tīrtta muṭait tiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Having caught [you] I kept you,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] I cannot let you go now,</l>
<l>Even if [you] conceal [yourself] with the magic arts!</l>
<l rend="indent">You who observes [your] vow to Tiru are faithful to none other!</l>
<l>My Father of Tirumāliruñcōlai with the sacred waters</l>
<l rend="indent">that circumambulate, creating clarity,</l>
<l>causing the bad karma of cityfolk, countryfolk</l>
<l rend="indent">and everyone everywhere else to vanish.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
